You can put something like this in your ~/.Rprofile

try({
  library(utils)
  library(rJava)
  .jinit()
  cc <- J("org.rosuda.JGR.JGR")
  library(JGR)
  cons <- cc$MAINRCONSOLE
  cons$setExtendedState(cons$MAXIMIZED_BOTH)
}, silent=TRUE)


it is trying to be more conservative in case you are running R outside JGR as well.

Cheers,
Simon

